  "title": [
    "[Evermore Hotel, Lounge]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "A haze of cigar smoke lingers above tuft-backed leather sofas that invite lounging in front of a stone fireplace with a silver-framed oil painting hanging above its blackened mantel.  Scattered along the dark wood-paneled walls, panes of stained glass separate tables into cozy booths.  A nacre-tiled clockface mosaic set into the polished floor seems to indicate that the time is perpetually midnight."
  ],
